Package: miadi-config
Version: 0.2.1
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash
Replaces: miadi (<< 0.2.0)
Breaks: miadi (<< 0.2.0)
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: Miadi host settings
 The MIADI_* settings of a Miadi host. /etc/miadi/miadi.env holds this
 host's values as plain KEY=VALUE, readable by systemd and docker too.
 /usr/share/miadi/env.sh resolves every other value, and login shells load
 it through /etc/profile.d/miadi.sh. The miadi-config command shows where
 each value comes from, sets and unsets this host's values, and checks the
 host.
